sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant Sys as BuildTrack System
    participant FM as Finance Manager
    participant Sup as Site Supervisor

    PM->>Sys: 1. Create New Project (Set Budget)
    Sys-->>PM: Project Created (Status: PLANNING)
    
    PM->>Sys: 2. Add BOQ Estimates (Concrete, Steel)
    
    FM->>Sys: 3. Create Bank Loan Facility ($1M)
    Sys-->>FM: Loan Created (Active)
    
    PM->>Sys: 4. Change Project Status to ACTIVE
    
    Sup->>Sys: 5. Submit Daily Log from Mobile App
    Sys-->>Sup: Log Saved (Photos sent to MinIO)
    
    PM->>Sys: 6. Purchase Concrete ($50k)
    PM->>Sys: Link Purchase to Bank Loan
    Sys-->>PM: Purchase Logged, BOQ Updated
    Sys-->>FM: Loan Outstanding Debt unchanged (purchase funded by loan, not repaid)
    
    FM->>Sys: 7. Record Loan Repayment ($10k)
    Sys->>Sys: Verify Repayment <= Outstanding Debt
    Sys->>Sys: Deduct $10k from Outstanding Debt
    Sys-->>FM: Repayment Logged
